{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15204130","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15204130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1520413001:0":{"text":"な、何があったんだ！？オレが出かけた時は、みんな普通だったのに！","source_cn":"怎、怎么回事……？！明明我离开之前，大家还好好的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BA87668568559BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520413002:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さま、あそこの人たちに見覚えがあります。","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE508847E7BCB2EB9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さま、あそこの人たちに見覚えがあります。","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さま、あそこの人たちに見覚えがあります。","variant_male_record_index":"184403","variant_female_record_index":"184404","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520413003:0":{"text":"……スピロクタスを食ったのか？","source_cn":"……又是吃了针蝗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76E928EC7A9118F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520413004:0":{"text":"そんなはずは……ここには、食べられるものなんて何もなかったはずだ……","source_cn":"不可能，我走之前，营地里已经连一粒能吃的东西都没有了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8C350134D231F28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520413005:1":{"text":"あれ？釜に肉のスープが……？一体どこから肉を……","source_cn":"等等，锅里有肉汤……我们明明早就没有肉可以吃了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1890D4ADBCF4531E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520413006:0":{"text":"……分かった！この人たち、<style=\"highlight\">腐った肉でスープを作った</style>んだ！","source_cn":"……我知道了！他们肯定是<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F6F991D6BD8FF2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520413007:0":{"text":"ったく……せめて食えるものを食ってくれよ。面倒くさい奴らだな。","source_cn":"要么没东西吃，要么就吃坏东西，真够麻烦的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE123CCBB6214986E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520413008:0":{"text":"本当に傷んだ肉を食べたせいなのか、もう一度<style=\"highlight\">彼らの容態を確認しましょう</style>。","source_cn":"再<style=highlight>检查一番他们的情况...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BD1ACCB880985FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:托洛":{"text":"トロウ","source":"托洛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"ガーラ","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:摩根":{"text":"モルガン","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"初代マーリン","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":4}}